window.products.push({"id":615248,"name":"MOHAP Pillowcase Pink Queen Zipper Set of 2 Pillow Protector Super Soft and Skin Friendly Microfiber for Plush Experience","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IBI0Rs5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIZE: Pack of 2 pillowcases both measure 20 by 30 inches. These pillowcases are cool in the summer and warm in the winter which could be used in many occasions such as bedroom, guest room, vocation home, hotel, office, couch, automobile etc,. Also, decent and portable package make it an ideal gift for any anniversary or holiday. Sleeping are vital in our life, to choose the best pillowcase is a simple and direct path to starting a pleasant life. SILVER ZIPPER: 2 Pack pillow encasement were stitched with silver zipper for each, exquisite craftsmanship and quality material does not allow incidental zipper broken. The zipper has been sewn twice, the zipper puller securely stays in place and pillow protectors can be used for many years. SOFT & DURABLE MATERIAL: Brushed microfiber technique was widely used in the textile market, especially in home goods domain. Microfiber fabric are silky soft against your skin, also they could prevent your hair from tangling and snagging. EASY CARE: These microfiber pillowcases were made from 100% quality polyester which featuring smooth touch and exceptional longevity, even after extensive wash and wear, it will looks as good as new. They are fade and shrink resistant, easy to care for, machine wash cold, tumble dry low. Do not Bleach. MOHAP GURANTEE: We have professional customer service team, any question or suggestion, please reach us and we will try our best to meet your need. In the past, we have received countless compliments from our clients. We are inspired by their support and appreciation, so we strive to constantly improve the product quality, to keep innovating stylish merchandise, aim to bringing you a sweet bedroom decoration and a colorful lifestyle.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61IBI0Rs5HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mohap","source_asin":"B08Z3GPKKF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615248","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Z3GPKKF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Z3GPKKF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
