window.products.push({"id":615255,"name":"Bed Sheet Straps Set 4 pcs - White Sheet Holders for Corners - Full Mattress Cover Fitted Sheet Clips to Hold Sheets in Place - Premium Nickel-plated ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o5WVgq+RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Premium Bed Sheet Holders - Enjoy a comfortable bed with the 5 STARS UNITED bed sheet holder straps! The set includes 4 triangle-shaped belts to securely hold each corner of your sheet in place. Our elastic bed sheet fasteners work for all sheet sizes from Twin to California King and ensure perfect tidiness in your bed. Made to Last - our fitted sheet elastic straps are made of elastic nylon for extended durability. The rust-resistant nickel-plated metal clips feature a built-in plastic clenching system to protect the fabric from damage. With our bedsheet holders, you will forget about loose sheets for good! Multipurpose – the 5 STARS UNITED sheet clips for bedding work with all types of fabric, and fit all kinds of sheets, throw blankets, covers for sofas, ironing boards, tables, chair/car/scooter seats and more. Easy To Install - 1) Open the clamp. 2) Put the fabric in the clamp. 3) Close the clamp to lock the fabric in place. Start by attaching the middle strap to the corner, then attach the side straps directly opposite to each other on both sides of the corner. Repeat for each corner. The fitted sheet holders are fully adjustable - tighten or loosen them by pulling on the buckles to get the desired tension. 100% Money-back guarantee - We want you to be absolutely happy with your Bed Sheet Holder! If it does not work for you for any reason, you may return it for a full refund. Buy it now safely!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o5WVgq+RL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5 STARS UNITED","source_asin":"B0C6K83KQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6K83KQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6K83KQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":615256,"name":"White Classic Luxury Bath Towels Large - Cotton Hotel spa Bathroom Towel |30x56 | 4 Pack | Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G36erNHLL._AC_SL1307_.jpg","description":"HOTEL COLLECTION - 4-Piece Bath Towels are provided in abundance. With dimensions of 30x56 inches, there is plenty of space for comfortable lounging after a refreshing shower or relaxing soak. Each towel is made of fluffy 700 GSM long-staple 100% combed cotton, which is soft, durable, quick-drying, and wonderfully absorbent. It absorbs more than any Turkish Cotton Towel. WRAP YOURSELF IN BLISSFUL LUXURY - You deserve a little luxury at the end of a long day, or at the start of a new one. With the help of White Classic deliciously soft, comfy elegant towels, you can transform your home into a sanctuary and your bathroom into a mini spa. A fantastic colour palette will make your bedroom look like it belongs in a magazine. Every time you use them, you will feel a true luxury super soft feel. The surface is smooth and difficult to shed, which adds to their durability. To prevent fraying from long-term use and laundering, the edges are reinforced with double needle embroidered stitching. Ideal for spa, poolside, bathroom, beach, salon, and college dorm room necessities. CARE INSTRUCTIONS - Toss them in the washing machine and wash. These towels will fluff up beautifully after the first wash and feel fresh and soft. These towels have been specially processed to make the dryer take less time, saving both time and energy. Maintain the cleanliness of the lint trap. Lint may be found in the first wash. YOU ARE AT NO RISK! With Our 2-Year Warranty Promise - WhiteClassic is a unique company that takes pride in providing the best customer service in the industry. If you are dissatisfied with your purchase at any time and for any reason, please contact us for a replacement (you do not even need to send the product back).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81G36erNHLL._AC_SL1307_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"White Classic","source_asin":"B09NMMTRSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NMMTRSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NMMTRSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":615257,"name":"Decorative Matte White Resin Vase - Contemporary Rustic Vintage Home Décor with Star Design - Large Size - Length 12.4 x Width 3.94 x Height 10.6 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jz1+InInL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILITY, CLASS & STYLE: This distinctive, handmade white vase is versatile – if you’re looking to create a vintage modern, rustic farmhouse or fully contemporary design, then look no further because this decorative white vase fits the bill, whatever your taste. It also provides a sophisticated, sleek, Nordic style vase minimalist look that boasts simplicity and elegance at its best! MULTI-FUNCTIONAL & DURABLE STRENGTH: It’s suitable for your office, living room, bedroom, dining room or for making a grand entrance statement in your home or corporate and hotel receptions. The embossed textures on the ridged star design complement the strength and durability of the resin material, making for a stunner wherever you place it. It’s perfect for use with fresh or faux flowers, or on its own as a decorative vase centrepiece. To create matching room accents, see our white vase set. HANDMADE, PREMIUM QUALITY - TOTALLY YOURS FOR KEEPS OR GIFTABLE: Although we know that you’re already taken by the elegant design, intricate handmade craftsmanship and premium quality of this delicately-styled home décor vase, it also serves an ideal gift for friends or family - consider gifting it for a wedding celebration, birthday, housewarming, thank you, Valentine’s day or at Christmas. THE FINE DETAILS: This eco-friendly, corrosion resistant, oversized resin vase is waterproof and suited for indoor use. The matte white colour has streaks of golden brown on the star shell design. It features a large and wide mouth opening, allowing ample space if you choose to display your favorite flower stems in it. It’s also low maintenance as you only need to wipe it clean with a soft, non-abrasive, dry cloth. PURCHASE WITH CONFIDENCE, 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEED: Rest assured with our 30-day money back guarantee. You’re buying a thoughtfully crafted, premium quality, handmade product, so we know you will love your purchase; however, if you’re not satisfied or find that there’s any issue, please contact us and you’ll have the choice of an immediate refund or replacement. We aim to put a smile on your face.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Jz1+InInL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUXTLEY","source_asin":"B08GJWXPZF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GJWXPZF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GJWXPZF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
