window.products.push({"id":615288,"name":"STATINT Silicone Oven Mitts, Extra Long Heat Resistant Oven Gloves with Quilted Liner, Flexible Non Slip Pot Holders for Kitchen Baking Cooking, Blue,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p4+LiyeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXTRA LONG INCLINED OPENING DESIGN& SOFT LINER: Unlike other kitchen gloves for oven on the market, our silicone oven mitts are 15'' long which longer than most, so that can better protect your fingers, hands, and wrists from burns when working over hot flames, ovens, stoves or grills. The unique inclined opening design can suit more sizes of hands. Soft cotton lining offers additional protection and comfort when cooking, while also remaining fully flexible and breathable. NON-SLIP TEXTURED & SLIP RESISTANT: Designed by anti-skid textured surface, these kitchen mittens provide improved control and stability, which help you to grip heavy pans, pots, and baking sheets without slips and spills. HEAT-RESISTANT & DURABLE: Our oven mitts silicone heat resistant are crafted with top quality silicone, offer you protection up to 446°F. They help protect hands and wrists from burns when cooking; also spare tender forearms from burns that can occur when your outdoor grill experiences a flare-up. WATERPROOF & STEAM RESISTANT: These cooking gloves are waterproof, which won’t absorb liquids, so steam and hot liquids won’t soak through and scald you. EASY CLEAN & STORE: Our silicone gloves are stain-resistant and easy to clean, just wash underwater with warm water or soap, they won’t be worn and torn. The inner quilted liner can be pulled out to clean, which is sewn at the seams so it’s never lost! With a cotton loop in each glove so they can be hung easily when not in use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p4+LiyeHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STATINT WINDOW FILMS","source_asin":"B08FC6619K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615288","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FC6619K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FC6619K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":615289,"name":"MI Air Purifiers for Home Large Room- Smart Wifi and PM2.5 Monitor- Voice Control Cleaner for Pets, Bedroom, Dust- Quiet Air Purifier Covers 398 Sq. F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":159.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ROMCiN2zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Breathe Easy with 3 Stages of Filtration】Highly effective for PM2.5, smoke, pollen, cooking odors, wildfire dust and removing 99.97% of common pollutants as small as 0.3 microns from the air in your office, bedroom, living room or kitchen, even 99.99% of the 0.1 microns particles. MI 3C air purifiers includes an advanced triple-layer filter comprised of a primary filter, high Efficiency Filter and an activated carbon layer. 【High Efficiency and Performance】The Mi 3C air purifier achieves 11301 ft³/h CADR while moving 5330 liters of purified air per minute, equals to purify air 5 times per hours for room of 323ft².Better than the true HEPA air filter with nanoscale precision filtration efficiently removes fine particles from your breathing space. Precision sensors monitor the current air quality and adjusts the speed in real time according to settings or automatically while delivering fresh air instantaneously 【Energy Saving & Easy Filter Core Changes】Ultra-low energy consumption of 0.7kWh per 24 hours is achieved through high quality internals. A brushless DC motor combined with an improved 360° air channel design ensures smooth and quiet operation. Automatic mode silently purifies until impurities are detected and ramps up the speed and reaches 29W max as large room air purifier. Filter cores can be conveniently changed in 3 easy steps. 【 Intelligent Control & Digital LED Display】The Mi 3C connects to your home via WIFI & APP, features AI voice control that allows you to interface with this smart device. Even on your way home, you can remotely operate it. Large display shows real-time PM2.5 values and is color coded for easy viewing even from across the room. A tri-color light ring can help you reference the current indoor quality at a glance. 【Small Footprint with Whisper Quiet Operation】With a base area similar to a sheet of A4 paper, the air purifiers for bedroom can be placed anywhere in your room and does its job while remaining nearly silent. Don’t forget to try the Sleep Mode which reduces the operating noise levels to a whisper quiet 31 dB, which is perfect for your bedroom or a child’s nursery.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ROMCiN2zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MI","source_asin":"B0B631DD4T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B631DD4T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B631DD4T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
