window.products.push({"id":615293,"name":"Organic CocoSoy Candles, Pack of 12 Red Tapered Candles 10 inch Tall Coconut Soy Wax Tapers, Long Stem Dripless Smokeless Dinner Taper Candles for Hom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KsdPVlIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CocoSoy Taper Candles are the Organic Coconut Soy Wax candles 7/8” D x 10\" H Each box contains 12 elegant, unscented taper candles of 3/4” diameter. Each candle is 10 inches long, hand-poured, and carefully wrapped in a beautiful window box. Our Eco Taper candles burn cleanly and freshen your air. Great for Dinner, Birthday Parties, Decorations, and Celebrations. Unlike other candles on the market such as paraffin Mega candles, our Eco Taper series is made from Coconut and Soy Veggie plants and has a pure cotton wick braised specifically for mini taper candles. The result is a biodegradable mini taper candle that burns 7.5 hours cleanly, bright, smoke-free, dripless, and with no harmful soot. Our Eco Mini Taper Candles are versatile and available in 14 colors Features: - Hand-poured Coconut, Soy, and Veggie Wax.- 100% cotton natural fiber wicks by Atkin & Pearces, USA.- 14 beautiful colors by Berko Germany Colorized.- Long burn time of 7.5 hours.- Smokeless and dripless. ABOUT US: CocoSoy Candles began as an innovative EcoLab applying Cornell's Plant Sciences and bringing to the market the best sustainable, eco friendly candles. Our objective is to replace millions of tons of harmful paraffin candles that release toxic fumes everyday. We combine the molecular structures of natural Coconut Soy Palm, flowers and plants to create candles that burn efficiently and release pure fresh air with natural aromas. We invented a special distillation process that has enabled us to manufacture plant-based wax that is cheaper than the paraffin wax. By using CocoSoy Candles, consumers can save money and save the planet by eliminating millions of tons of harmful petroleum paraffin.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KsdPVlIYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CocoSoy Candles","source_asin":"B09JHNP3NL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615293","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JHNP3NL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JHNP3NL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
