window.products.push({"id":615462,"name":"H&D HYALINE & DORA Crystal Art Blue Butterfly Craft Sculpture Glass Glaze Animal Figurine Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UMrZ6oCFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Unique Crystal Butterfly Design: The crystal butterfly is a perfect combination of ancient hand culture and modern art. Its brilliance and change are magnificent, express the delicate and subtle embodiment of the oriental people. Not only is the process complicated, but pure hand-made means exquisite craftsmanship. Our crystal art butterfly decor is beautifully made and the light blue color will be brighter in the sun. Exquisite Crystal Figurine detail: The unique three-dimensional pattern and translucent color of the crystal butterfly make it unique in the beauty of hazy and perspective, and the effect presented is very ornamental. Will never fade or oxidize. The simple and smooth outline makes the butterfly crystal art figurine lifelike and unique. Material: Crystal. Size: 3.1*1.2in. NW.: 44g. Gift box packed. Unique gift Choice:It is suitable for all kinds of holiday gifts, such as Mother's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, Birthday, Teacher's Day, Valentine's Day, Wedding and other important occasions. It’s impossible to find the same second piece of liuli crystal art ornament, each one is unique which makes it even more precious. Give this unique gift to your unique person. Elegant Butterfly Art Figurine: Make good use of indoor light, such as matching colored luminous lights, and place this art miniature collectible sculpture in your collection cabinet or corner to create a warm and romantic indoor environment, add a mood to your home. You could also place it on bookshelves, mantels, TV cabinets, bedside tables, desks and other scenes to show its beauty. Worry-free Aftersales: All of the H&D Crystal pieces are lovingly hand-produced in China, using traditional lost wax sculpting techniques, the color and dimensions will vary slightly. During the production, the gaps between colorful crystals blocks will naturally form bubbles. It is the unique charms of crystal art sculpture, which will not affect its own beauty at all. If you have any problems with your package, we will solve for you asap.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UMrZ6oCFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"H&D HYALINE & DORA","source_asin":"B0BN81ZLJK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615462","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN81ZLJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN81ZLJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
