window.products.push({"id":615636,"name":"Birthday Gifts for Men, Whiskey Stones Gifts Set for Fathers Day Christmas, Best Gifts for Men Dad Husband Boss Birthday Party Holiday Present","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SMqbwknoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy To Use, Enjoy The Original Taste】Just can put the whiskey stone in the frozen layer of the refrigerator directly. After freezing for 6-8 hours, you can enjoy the wine with a cool taste. Keeps the original flavor of the beverage, without ice dilution. The whisky stone will be a nice choice for those who want to drink authentic chilling whiskey. drink the original taste without diluting the whisky, our stones not only can use with whiskey but also with gin, wine, vodka even water! 【Perfect Gift For Whiskey Lover】The Whiskey Stone and glass set is packaged in a wooden gift box and comes with two fine whiskey glasses, whether it's for friends or relatives, birthdays or holidays or parties, it's an amazing choice. I believe that everyone of any age or gender will definitely love it, an ideal option for your dad, boyfriend, husband, fiance, friends, or grandpa at any festival, like Christmas, Father's Day, Birthday, Valentines Day, Retirement Gifts. 【Easy To Clean And Store】Just put the whiskey stone cubes in the freezer for 3-5 hours. It can drop the temperature quickly, the cooling effect is better than ice cubes, also can used for ice compresses. The whiskey chilling stones also can be washed by water directly and repeat to use. The stone was packed in the custom velvet bag and put them in fridge to freeze, avoiding odors from other foods into the stones, clean and odor free. 【Durable Quality】Our Whiskey Stones are made of the finest natural stones, effective and safe to use. And the smooth whiskey rocks won't scratch your glass cup, take assured to use, and improve the taste level. Use a new way to enhance your drinking experience, Chilling whiskey without diluting the ice cube. 【What You Get】8 x Chilling Natural Whiskey Stones, 1 x Wooden Gift Box, 2 x Crystal Whiskey Glasses, 1 x Non-slip Stone Tong, 1 x Black Velvet Bag and our worry-free after-sale customer service. We have been pursuing customer satisfaction, if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will be here to help you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SMqbwknoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HKDGYHON","source_asin":"B0BN1KM1CS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615636","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN1KM1CS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN1KM1CS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
