window.products.push({"id":615643,"name":"HOME-X Butter Crock, Stoneware Butter Container, Bell-Shaped Butter Keeper for Easily Spreadable Butter, 3 ¾\" D x 3 ¾\" H, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JnAeygIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This cute butter dish is a standout piece when it comes to kitchen tools and dinnerware. This sturdy butter holder and elegant storage container is a great way to keep your butter fresh for a longer period of time while shielding it from stray crumbs, specks of dust, or spillage as you carry it around the kitchen or to the dining room. The rounded design of the butter saver gives it a clean look that will complement the rest of your kitchen accessories. This butter dish is a great addition to any home. The blue stoneware design will lend a stylish accent to your kitchen's color scheme or design style, from classic to modern. It won’t take up excessive kitchen counter or table space and will easily fit on a full table or in a crowded cabinet. The unique bell-style design allows you to safely transport it between the kitchen and the dining room or any eating spot you choose. You can easily hand wash this stoneware crock. This dish is perfect for butter storage and is also designed with an easy-to-grip handle so you can safely and securely remove the butter-filled cover. Keep your butter conveniently within reach so you can quickly move the lid on and off whether you're cooking, eating, or putting away groceries. The wide, round knob matches the beautiful design of the dish and is also functional, allowing you to set the inner dish upright and easily access the contents. We know you’ll love our classic covered butter dish and that it will become an essential piece of your kitchenware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51JnAeygIGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B09172QBVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615643","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09172QBVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09172QBVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
