window.products.push({"id":615802,"name":"Caannasweis Griddle Pan, Granite Flat Grill Pan for Stove Tops Nonstick,Stone Pan Square Griddle Pan Induction Compatible 9.5 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814vHU+zXKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"How a Great Idea come up with？🤔🤔🤔 It all originates from questions. We always have some questions:Does there exist aliens? 👽Which one come first,eggs or chickens?🐣🐔 Of course,same as the creation of stone frying pan🍳🍳🍳: Nowdays,more and more people advocate coming back to simple and natural life. /p> Why not come back to the ancient Stone Age? Doesn’t it sound interesting? Our Pans, Casseroles,Milk Pans,Hot Pots,Grill Pans...all are made of stone texture. So cool! We still have a big targe: Make everybody own a set of stone cookware in their kitchen. Does it sound ridiculous? At least,we don’t think so. We have confidence to achieve it step by step. So just try and buy it!?👍👍👍 Warm Tips for Stone Pans' Usage 1.Before the first time use, please remove the packing material and all the tags, clean with detergent or warm water, then coats a thin layer of oil or other grease. 2.Cooking Tools - Plastic utensils and wooden tools are more suitable. Sharp tools will damage your pans during long time use. 3.Cleaning way - Better way: Hand washed gently with soft cloth and dry it. For cleaning of stubborn food stain, you'd better soak the pot in hot water with detergent for a period of time. In general, a pot with non-stick coating can be washed by dishwasher, but is not recommended to do so as strength of aluminium substrate will be reduced and the edible oil of the coating will be fully rinsed, therefore, it needs to be reapplied with a coat of oil. The use of dishwasher may reduce the service life of the pot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/814vHU+zXKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Caannasweis","source_asin":"B081F493XW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615802","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081F493XW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081F493XW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":615803,"name":"Beanpod Candles, Soy Beads - Fresh Linen, (Pack of 3)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ndc9iT98L.jpg","description":"Beanpod Candles are made from 100% stabilized natural soy wax. A paraffin free fragrant candle that's clean and healthy for the environment. Imagine your room filled with the scent of fresh, sun kissed Linen. Beanpod Soy Beads for melters, jar candles, warmers and burners are like wickless candles. Create your own unique fragrance by mixing different scents with Beanpod Candles' Soy Beads. Beanpod Soy Beads are more convenient than wax tarts since you pour only the amount needed so the scent stays fresher. Also giving you the ability to mix in other flavors to make your own custom scent creations. No need to freeze and chip out the remaining residue. When you are done with that batch or ready to change up fragrances simply wash out left over residue(while still warm) with soap and water! Easy cleanup! In a convenient clear tube that is re-sealable.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ndc9iT98L.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kizenka","source_asin":"B01AB39H4A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AB39H4A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AB39H4A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
