window.products.push({"id":615865,"name":"GreenHouzz Artificial Peony Silk Flower Centerpieces Faux Floral Arrangement in Glass Vase for Home Wedding Table Decoration (Dark Burgundy)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YQAh9RA7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Romantic and Sweet: This lovely faux floral arrangement features seven silk peonies and greenery in a clear square glass vase, and a long green leaf inside the vase to make a unique design. No maintenance or water required. Looks full and fresh every day, wipe clean with a soft dry cloth. Look Natural: Flowers and leaves both is made of premium quality silk, so the elegant nearly natural peony look feels like those of fresh flower. This square vase is crafted of high quality, blemish-free, crystal clear glass and it features thick glass walls and weighted base to ensure durability. Perfect Decorations for Home & Events: Use as centerpieces for the party table, weeding table, dining table, coffee table, kitchen counters or side table, this peony arrangement brings a burst of refreshing floral flair to any space, perfect for all occasions. Best Gift & DIY: The flowers and leaf can come completely out the pot and are not securely fastened, you can add stones, acrylic or “faux water” to change the look. This peony arrangement also is a beautiful gift for Valentine’s Day, anniversary, birthday etc. Arrangement is /Approximate Dimensions: Overall - 8 In. W x 8 In. D x 7 In. H. Vase - 4 In. W x 4 In H. Flower - 3.1 In","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YQAh9RA7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreenHouzz","source_asin":"B0BKZQRVGZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-615865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKZQRVGZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKZQRVGZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
